      "definitions": "<h3>Wiktionary senses</h3><ul><li><b>S1</b>: A headlining wrestler with a persona embodying heroic or virtuous traits and who is regarded as a &quot;good guy&quot;, especially one who is handsome and well-conditioned; a baby face.</li></ul><h3>Candidates</h3><ul><li><b>T1</b> (oewn-03318401-n): a vertical surface of a building or cliff</li><li><b>T2</b> (oewn-03318547-n): the side upon which the use of a thing depends (usually the most prominent surface of an object)</li><li><b>T3</b> (oewn-03318818-n): the striking or working surface of an implement</li><li><b>T4</b> (oewn-04686776-n): the general outward appearance of something</li><li><b>T5</b> (oewn-04687095-n): the feelings expressed on a person&#x27;s face</li><li><b>T6</b> (oewn-04845441-n): impudent aggressiveness</li><li><b>T7</b> (oewn-05176322-n): status in the eyes of others</li><li><b>T8</b> (oewn-05608392-n): the front of the human head from the forehead to the chin and ear to ear</li><li><b>T9</b> (oewn-05608953-n): the part of an animal corresponding to the human face</li><li><b>T10</b> (oewn-06838449-n): a specific size and style of type within a type family</li><li><b>T11</b> (oewn-06890628-n): a contorted facial expression</li><li><b>T12</b> (oewn-08527687-n): a surface forming part of the outside of an object</li><li><b>T13</b> (oewn-09641987-n): a part of a person that is used to refer to a person</li></ul>",
